  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Who is SHAMEGRIN?",
      "a": "SHAMEGRIN is the music project of Canadian artist Gary Makinson \u2014 dark emo rap, spoken word, and cinematic 4K music videos. 100K+ monthly streams, 71+ official videos, and a global underground audience finding the sound at 3am."
    },
    {
      "q": "Why does Gary write music for people with anxiety?",
      "a": "Gary built SHAMEGRIN from real nights with anxiety \u2014 racing thoughts, tight chest, smiling while breaking. The songs name the fear when nobody has the words, especially at 3am when the world is asleep."
    },
    {
      "q": "Where can I stream SHAMEGRIN?",
      "a": "Stream on Spotify & Apple Music, SoundCloud, and YouTube. Start with Outrun the Crash or The Best of SHAMEGRIN playlist."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is Outrun the Crash about?",
      "a": "The flagship SHAMEGRIN anthem about survival: \"I don't wanna die \u2014 I just don't wanna feel like this anymore.\" Cinematic 4K dark emo rap for anyone who needed to hear it at 3am."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is SHAMEGRIN on TikTok?",
